                           Alex Kolman
                           Okimura base

Dear &.

Please, no more ranks between us.
You saved my life at Ekimoz, you can ask me anything,
I will do everything possible to obtain it for you.

The President asked me to send her a complete file on the
state of your services. I think she has got you in her good
books, it's very good for you my boy.
You will go far, it's certain.

But first of all you must achieve the supreme victory :
I am of course talking about the Golf Officers Tournament.

You have a strong swing but you lack precision.
Also I want you on the field tomorrow morning.

Training starts at 6h30, be punctual.